.TH MATH 3 "2026" "y-- standard library" "y-- Library Reference"
.SH NAME
Math \- mathematical functions and physical constants
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B Math
module provides mathematical functions (arithmetic, trigonometry, logarithms)
and physical/mathematical constants.
All angle arguments and return values are in
.B radians
unless noted otherwise.
.PP
.B Constants
.TP
PI = 3.141592653589793
.TP
E = 2.718281828459045
.TP
PHI = 1.618033988749894  (golden ratio)
.TP
G = 6.6743e-11  (gravitational constant, m\[u00B3] kg\[u207B]\[u00B9] s\[u207B]\[u00B2])
.TP
G_EARTH = 9.80665  (standard gravity, m/s\[u00B2])
.TP
EPSILON_0 = 8.8541878128e-12  (vacuum permittivity, F/m)
.TP
PLANCK_H = 6.62607015e-34  (Planck constant, J\[u00B7]s)
.SH FUNCTIONS
.SS Abs
float()|int()|bigint() Abs(num)
.br
Absolute value.  Return type matches input type.
.SS Floor
int() Floor(num)
.br
Largest integer <= num.  int/bigint input returned unchanged.
.SS Ceil
int() Ceil(num)
.br
Smallest integer >= num.  int/bigint input returned unchanged.
.SS Sqrt
float() Sqrt(num)
.br
Square root.  Raises \fBValueError\fR if num < 0.
.SS Cbrt
float() Cbrt(num)
.br
Cube root.  Supports negative values.
.SS Sgn
int() Sgn(num)
.br
Sign function: 1 if num > 0, -1 if num < 0, 0 if num == 0.
.SS RadToDeg
float() RadToDeg(num)
.br
Converts radians to degrees (num * 180 / PI).
.SS DegToRad
float() DegToRad(num)
.br
Converts degrees to radians (num * PI / 180).
.SS MapRange
float() MapRange(num, in_min, in_max, out_min, out_max)
.br
Linearly maps num from [in_min, in_max] to [out_min, out_max].
Returns out_min if in_min == in_max.
.SS RoundToPower
int()|float() RoundToPower(number, power)
.br
Rounds number to the nearest 10^power.
Positive power = round to larger units; negative = decimal places.
.SS ConvertToBase
string() ConvertToBase(num_str, curr_base, target_base)
.br
Converts the string num_str from base curr_base to target_base (2-36).
Returns the result as an uppercase string.
.SS Sin
float() Sin(num)
.br
Sine of num (radians).
.SS Cos
float() Cos(num)
.br
Cosine of num (radians).
.SS Tan
float() Tan(num)
.br
Tangent of num (radians).
.SS Sinh
float() Sinh(num)
.br
Hyperbolic sine.
.SS Cosh
float() Cosh(num)
.br
Hyperbolic cosine.
.SS Tanh
float() Tanh(num)
.br
Hyperbolic tangent.
.SS Arcsin
float() Arcsin(num)
.br
Arc sine in radians.  Domain: [-1, 1].
.SS Arccos
float() Arccos(num)
.br
Arc cosine in radians.  Domain: [-1, 1].
.SS Arctan
float() Arctan(num)
.br
Arc tangent in radians.  Output: (-PI/2, PI/2).
.SS Atan2
float() Atan2(y, x)
.br
Four-quadrant arc tangent.  Output: (-PI, PI].
.SS Arcsinh
float() Arcsinh(num)
.br
Inverse hyperbolic sine.
.SS Arccosh
float() Arccosh(num)
.br
Inverse hyperbolic cosine.  Domain: [1, inf).
.SS Arctanh
float() Arctanh(num)
.br
Inverse hyperbolic tangent.  Domain: (-1, 1).
.SS Log
float() Log(num)
.br
Natural logarithm (base e).  Raises \fBValueError\fR if num < 0.
.SS Log2
float() Log2(num)
.br
Base-2 logarithm.  Raises \fBValueError\fR if num < 0.
.SS Log10
float() Log10(num)
.br
Base-10 logarithm.  Raises \fBValueError\fR if num < 0.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
Random(3)
